    method → GET or POST

-> <label> → Describes the input field

-> for="fname" → Connects label with input

-> type="text" → Allows text input , and like wise for email , password , radio , checkbox , date , number

-> id="fname" → Unique identifier

-> pattern="[0-9]{10}" → Regular Expression validation

-> <textarea> → Multi-line text input

-> type="radio" → Select only one option

-> type="checkbox" → Select multiple options

-> For gender :
    <input type="radio" name="gender" id="male" checked> Male
    <input type="radio" name="gender" id="female"> Female
    type="radio" → Select only one option
    Same name="gender" groups them together
    checked → Male selected by default

